I bear full responsibility for the projects implementation, ensuring that the customer requirements are fully met within the agreed timelines and budget. In details, I'm accountable for:
• Analysis of client requirements by eliciting, elaborating and documenting business and functional requirements in user stories, main and alternative flow diagrams, including block diagrams in Visio, wireframes;
• Collaboration with Developers, Engineers and QA when discussing the solution architecture, estimation, acceptance criteria to ensure that the team understands what the client should get in result; prototyping solutions and presentation to the clients and the team;
• Management of client requirements (new requests, change requests) in Confluence, getting approvals from the clients regarding the scope and estimations.
• Scope planning for sprints in Jira by prioritizing the tasks; participating in sprint planning, retrospective to ensure that the tasks are processed according agreed priorities and timelines;
• Following up and reporting the progress;
• Creating use cases / test scenario; review test results together with QA; test custom solutions prior to the deployment;
• Presentation solutions to the client; helping client with the UAT to ensure customer satisfaction and acceptance.

